@startuml 15-seq-auth
!include style.iuml
title Authentication - password sign-in, refresh rotation and Google
autonumber
participant "Browser" as B
participant "API" as A
participant "Google" as G
== Password sign-in ==
B -> A : POST /auth/login { username, password }
A --> B : Set-Cookie torfun_token (15 min), torfun_refresh (30 days)
== Normal request, then expiry ==
B -> A : any request (cookies)
A --> B : 401 when the access token has expired
B -> A : POST /auth/refresh (refresh cookie)
A -> A : rotate token.\nReuse of a revoked token revokes the whole family
A --> B : new cookie pair
== Google ==
B -> A : GET /auth/google
A --> B : 302 to Google
B -> G : consent
G --> B : redirect with code
B -> A : GET /auth/google/callback
A --> B : set cookies, 302 to WEB_APP_URL
@enduml
